    "title": "What’s new in 0.25.3 (October 31, 2019) — pandas 3.1.0.dev0 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# What’s new in 0.25.3 (October 31, 2019)#\n\nThese are the changes in pandas 0.25.3. See Release notes for a full changelog including other versions of pandas.\n\n## Bug fixes#\n\n### GroupBy/resample/rolling#\n\n- Bug in `DataFrameGroupBy.quantile()` where NA values in the grouping could cause segfaults or incorrect results (GH 28882)\n\n## Contributors#\n\nA total of 2 people contributed patches to this release. People with a “+” by their names contributed a patch for the first time.\n\n- Will Ayd\n- William Ayd",
